<title>BELGIUM: Belgian 2007 OLO auctioned at average 6.006 pct.</title>
<headline>Belgian 2007 OLO auctioned at average 6.006 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Treasury gave the following details about the outcome of its monthly auction -</p>
<p>* 6.25 pct, March 2007 OLO </p>
<p>    Avg weighted price / yield   101.750 / 6.006 pct</p>
<p>    Price range of bids	    101.60 to 101.75</p>
<p>Stop (lowest accepted) price 101.75</p>
<p>    Percentage taken at stop     62.77</p>
<p>    Amount allotted		  13.045 billion francs</p>
<p>* 4.00 pct, Jan 2000 OLO </p>
<p>    Avg weighted price / yield   99.782 / 4.081 pct</p>
<p>    Price range of bids	    99.70 to 99.80</p>
<p>Stop (lowest accepted) price 99.75</p>
<p>    Percentage taken at stop     23.29</p>
<p>    Amount allotted		  10.065 billion francs</p>
<p>NOTE - Payment due on May 29;</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
